package CanvasNet {
    part def DataFileResolver {
        doc /* The internal DataFileResolver (a sealed class) and the DataFile record it returns: a thin layer over the core SandboxedFileResolver that finds and reads the local data files that a chart names with a relative data url, once per measure or render call. The core sandbox searches the base directory and then each data path in order (or, with the caller's file callback, never touches the file system and hands the callback only normalized logical paths), rejects empty, absolute, rooted, drive, UNC, colon, and control-character paths and a path that leaves its root, refuses any symbolic link or junction below a root (a dangling link included, failing closed when the check cannot be completed) while trusting the root itself, reads bytes under MaxDataBytes (an endless stream stops one chunk past the limit) and opens files read-only with shared access; environment variables and the current directory are never consulted. This unit adds at most MaxDataFiles distinct files per call, strict UTF-8 decoding with the byte-order mark removed, a decoded-file cache for the call, and the translation of every SandboxException into a VegaLiteRenderException located at the data url with Vega-Lite wording. A missing, blocked, unreadable (an existing file whose open fails, which is never reported as missing, a directory in place of a file, or a callback or callback stream that throws or fails to dispose), invalid, or oversized file is a VegaLiteRenderException, never an empty result; cancellation passes through unchanged. Remote URLs never reach it. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Data/DataFileResolver.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataFileResolverTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataFileResolverLinkTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataTestSupport.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-file-resolver.yaml */
    }
}
